## Workflow

1. Make changes to manifests in `{{ repo_layout.environment_dir }}/` or `{{ repo_layout.app_sources_root }}/`.
2. Commit and push to this repository.
3. {{ provider }} automatically reconciles the changes.
4. Forgejo sends a webhook to trigger immediate reconciliation on push.
{% if include_sample_webapp and provider == "argocd" %}
5. For ArgoCD PR previews, Forgejo also sends `pull_request` events from `{{ app_repo }}` to the ApplicationSet controller webhook.
{% endif %}

This setup assumes one LoKO environment owns one Forgejo instance. GitOps repos,
org secrets, and org webhooks are managed within that environment-local Forgejo org.
